{"ready":true,"data":{"id":"miguel-ferrer","name":"Miguel Ferrer","birthDate":"1955-02-07","birthPlace":"Santa Monica, California, USA","bio":"Miguel José Ferrer (February 7, 1955 – January 19, 2017) was an American actor. His breakthrough role was as Bob Morton in the 1987 film RoboCop. Other film roles include Quigley in Blank Check (1994), Harbinger in Hot Shots! Part Deux (1993), Shan Yu in Mulan (1998), Eduardo Ruiz in Traffic (2000) and Vice President Rodriguez in Iron Man 3 (2013). Ferrer's notable television roles include FBI Agent Albert Rosenfield on Twin Peaks (1990–1991, 2017), Tarakudo on Jackie Chan Adventures (2000–2005), Dr. Garret Macy on Crossing Jordan (2001–2007) and NCIS Assistant Director Owen Granger on NCIS: Los Angeles (2012–2017).","source":"TMDB","fetchedAt":"2026-11-16T12:08:54+00:00","tmdbId":15860,"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/15860","credits":[{"id":"iron-man-3","title":"Iron Man 3","character":"Vice President Rodriguez"}],"photo":"./public-data/images/people/miguel-ferrer.webp","filmography":[{"name":"The Movies That Made Us","year":2019,"character":"Self (archive footage)","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/l7p40cVratmPTdWrx4UFjZbANKF.jpg"},{"name":"Teen Titans: The Judas Contract","year":2017,"character":"Deathstroke (voice)","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/nuGIlNAJUati4qEAH1nrYKUA3xa.jpg"},{"name":"See You on the Other Side Dear Friend","year":2017,"character":"Self","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/2RhsONQg3Uhhe4LdIQY0LQADLcu.jpg"},{"name":"Twin Peaks: The Missing Pieces","year":2014,"character":"FBI Agent Albert Rosenfield","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/qwmqEAgar7vkpAQLfQYN4UfVO52.jpg"},{"name":"Rio 2","year":2014,"character":"Big Boss (voice)","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/gVNTBrjxh2YRmQFjlaqrNbHVvrd.jpg"},{"name":"Iron Man 3","year":2013,"character":"Vice President R